flowchart TD
    A[Local TXT / text PDF] --> B[Parse document and section headings]
    B --> C[Sections tagged with document, section, title, fictional flag]
    Q[Question] --> D[Classify supported category]
    C --> E[Lexical retrieval]
    D --> E
    E --> F{Relevant sections found?}
    F -- No --> U[Unsupported response + office contact]
    F -- Yes --> G{Same-title conflicting sections?}
    G -- Yes --> X[Conflict response; no selected rule]
    G -- No --> H[Prompt / deterministic evidence response]
    H --> I[Check document and section identity]
    I --> J[Check exact quote is in source]
    J --> K[Check answer is contained in verified quote]
    K --> L{All checks pass?}
    L -- No --> U
    L -- Yes --> M[Supported response with source and confidence]
